## 2. Summary of Changes (Before vs. After Overview)

| Component / Aspect | BEFORE (Legacy `wp_update_pds_flag`) | AFTER (Refactored KN-221 Packages) |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Package Structure & Naming** | Single monolithic package: `wp_update_pds_flag.sh`, `wp_update_pds_flag.sql`, `wp_update_pds_flag.ifb`, `wp_count_pds_flag.sql` | Two decoupled, single-responsibility packages:<br>1. **Package 1 (PDS Flag Hierarchy):** `wp_kn221_update_pds_flag.*`<br>2. **Package 2 (Expire Entitlement):** `wp_kn221_expire_entitlement.*` |
| **Hierarchy Resolution (Scenario I)** | Single-level subquery on `MASTER_OU_ID`. Updated flag only on parent and staged only child POs in `EIM_DEFECT`. | Full recursive hierarchy traversal using `CONNECT BY NOCYCLE PRIOR ROW_ID = PAR_OU_ID` plus `MASTER_OU_ID` matching, updating and refreshing both the Group Merchant and all child POs at all levels. |
| **Idempotency & Skipping Logic** | No filter on current `X_WP_PRI_PDS_FLG` value. Re-processed records already set to `'Y'` (relying on EIM `DUP_RECORD_EXISTS`). | Package 1 filters `NVL(org.X_WP_PRI_PDS_FLG, 'N') <> 'Y'` so merchants already set to `'Y'` are never sent to EIM or Role Refresh. Package 2 safely catches `NO_DATA_FOUND` for missing agreements and skips expired entitlements. |
| **Pricing Entitlement Expiry (Scenario II)** | Tightly coupled with PDS Flag update. Failed if `CX_AGREE_ORG` had no row. | Dedicated script evaluating `sNewDate := TRUNC(SYSDATE) - 1` once at run start. Handles missing active agreements gracefully without aborting. |
| **Role Refresh Federation (AMS)** | Called `wp_update_tra_status.sh EIM_ACCOUNT OBJECT_NUM 2001000 2002000` (mismatched with `EIM_DEFECT` populated in SQL at `2901900`). | Synchronized batch ranges (`2901900-2901999` for Package 1; `2902000-2902999` for Package 2) and table parameters (`EIM_DEFECT DEFECT_NUM`). Populates `EIM_DEFECT` strictly for updated parties. |
| **IFB Configuration** | Included both `"IMPORT_PDS_FLAG"` (`EIM_ACCOUNT`) and `"UPDATE_PRICING_SERVICE"` (`EIM_ENTLMNT`) under `[IMPORT_ALL]`. | Package 1 `.ifb` runs only `[IMPORT_PDS_FLAG]` (`EIM_ACCOUNT`). Package 2 `.ifb` runs only `[UPDATE_PRICING_SERVICE]` (`EIM_ENTLMNT`). |
| **Audit Reporting & Verification** | Unscoped updates on `PDS_MIGRATED_PARTY@EDS_AMS_DBLINK` without `CREATED_BY` filter; lacked per-party `UPDATED / SKIPPED / FAILED` report. | Scoped to `CREATED_BY = '&1'`. Produces detailed per-party audit report (`UPDATED`, `SKIPPED`, `FAILED` with reason) and ends with framework-compliant error check query. |

